'''Star Peng''' (スター・ペン, ''Sutā Pen'', '''Star Pen''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Jackie Peng]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

