==Trivia==
*Star Peng is likely a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Ultraman|Ultraman]]'' kaiju [[wikia:ultra:Bemstar|Bemstar]], as both are avian extraterrestrials with the word "star" in their name, a horn-like protrusion on their head and a pentagon-in-a-pentagon on their belly.
*Star Peng's Japanese description may be a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Dr. Slump|Dr. Slump]]'' character [[wikia:drslump:Senbei Norimaki|Senbei Norimaki]], as it mentions that Star Peng is a scientist and lives in the "[[wikia:drslump:Penguin Village|Pen Guin Village]]".
*According to Star Peng's Japanese description, his attack animation is him promoting the idea of doing cartwheels for a healthy mind by demonstrating this exercise in front of others. Since no other character is known to do cartwheels, it's safe to say it hasn't caught on.
*His gender is confirmed in the Taiwanese version, where all of the non-event [[Jackie Peng|Pengs]]' names contain 大哥 ''dàgē'', which means "eldest/big brother" or "male leader/boss (especially of a gang)", but can also be used as a respectful form of address for a young or middle-aged man who is older or holds a higher position than you. Star Peng is named 宙星・企鵝大哥 ''Zhòuxīng Qì'é Dàgē'' (roughly meaning "Cosmic Star Big Bro Penguin").
*His English description used to have a typo, where it said "''thanks, thanks'' to a culture of daily sudoku", repeating the word "thanks" unnecessarily.

